<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Onobasulu Translation</book>
  <para style="h">Aganebo Kolidi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Folohe Kolidi Sesefea Sowi Aganebo Ewe Selefia Mebailu</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Kolidi</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Kld</para>
  <para style="rem">1st draft with Yobe and Joseph and Johann in Ukarumpa, Sept 2020; with all translators and Johann in Walagu, Oct 2020</para>
  <para style="rem">Advisor Check of chapter 1-7 with Felix Waibo, Joseph Hambowali and Jack Wasele and Anne Stoppels, Beverly Mosley via Zoom, September 2022.</para>
  <para style="rem">Advisor Check of chapter 8-13 with Wabele Fuga, Yobe Maibi and Dickson Wadaga in October 2023</para>
  <para style="rem">Consutant check with Dunan Kasokason in Walagu - Feb 2024</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Kolidi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Folohe Kolidi Sesefea Sowi Aganebo Ewe Selefia Mebailu</para>
  <para style="imt">Sulu samini alegaeyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Folo alolu fogomo, Giligi hele Akaea fogoba asuluiya ami, Kolidi sidi bule uleno ami ufulu. Kolidi sidi amimo, Folo enedale maugaba Yesune sulu mana walelu. Aufia, ehe sidi ami sese maugalu. Auluso, Folo e ili gadefia, dabalu nolobalo moloyone aafe fogomo, higinilu noolo Kolidi sese ami holobagasia, inolo noolo mana wolu bule nokene molosia waalelu. Aulune, Folohe asigilo nafulu mesia, ine higinilu amone isosia, sowi Agele ilifea seleba mebailu. Aufia, hamu noolo daafia labi, Folohe sowi Aganebo ewe ilifea seleba mebailu. Sowi Agele selelu amodai, Aganebo selelu amodai, aleba ami, Folohe sowi no seleba ufulububa besabe. (2 Kolidi 2.3, 4 ami bamale.) Auluso, sowi amo asigilelubu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kolidi sese aleba ami, inolo noolohe Folofea woba selesi, e-mo libo higinilu koleba. E Kolidi idele inolodai haiba heneba obegeyone, sulu ili galiba isoyofia, sowi ewe ami seleba mebailu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Folohe sowi aganebo ewe seleyo maugasiamo, sulu kolelu e samini Kolidi idele inolofea solu amone fadaba selesia, maugaba selelu. Sulu kolelu amo, ehe ilifea saeyale hiliseluso, ili noolo elelisia, efea woba solune, e ene libo bule higinisia, sulu kolelu ewe ilifea ami solu. Ausi, ili sowi agele amo alegafasia, ilihe Folone sulu kuliba abia, ine mana isolu. Aulune, e aga ilidai haiba heneba obegeyone, sowi aganebo ewe selelu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hilia fogo amoyamo, keliso idele inolo Yudia hele ami asulu ilifeamo higinilu bule holobagasia, ili kulilu inolo amogulu alebailu. Aufia, Folo ehe mole ilifea meyone molaba gagaiyolabia siba alolu. Aulugulu, lalolu 8-dai 9-dai amimo, Folohe Kolidi idele inolo ilifeamo amone molemo dafogomesi, ine libomo degeba ofelesia sulu solu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Folohe sowi ewe elosia, eweguba selelu. Kolidi sese usu ami, masega hilibaisi daalu inolo noolo milibaifia, ami sigia, Folo ene wi dufa dafogosia, seale hilibaisi daalu inolomo, nini kolebaba selaba alolu. Aufia, ilihe Folone hilibaisi daalu dabalu mololu amo, lasiaba selaba alolu. Lalolu 10-12 amimo, Folohe ine sulu solu amone eweguba obegeba solu. Dabalu na moloba lolu amofea alefasia, nagada, higiniluda, diaba lolu amohe walesia, na seale hilibaisi daalu inoloba walefe. Folo auba selelu.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Separator Artwork for the Onobasulu NT - Waves" file="Separator1Onobasulu.tiff" size="span" loc="Between Book entry and text of the NT" copy="Johann Alberts, based on Onobasulu artwork" ref="1.0" /></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Na <char style="w">Folo</char>, Gode Ene hame alefasia, na iminilugulu, <char style="w">Keliso</char> Yesune <char style="w">hilibaisi daalu inolo</char> ulenomo, na lolu. Nada, ne nelewo <char style="w" lemma="Dimodi">Dimodida</char>, anihe,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CO 1:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Sowi ewe, Kolidi sese idele inolo gili amofeada, <char style="w" lemma="Godene muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> <char style="w">Akaea</char> helea ami kakainabu ili suniafeada, seleba mebaisu.<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Nine Nao Godedai, <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu Kelisodaihe, gilifea kanuluba ofelesia, gine asigine libo esebalo gadaeaba melesi moloyobafe.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godehe nine libo aeaba ofolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:5">Lom 15.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ninihe Nao Godene wi digiyoba. E nine Saminilo Yesu Kelisone Enao ligia, Gode labe. Yagunagaba ofolo amone Enaomo, E. Libo aeaba ofolo amone maumo, E koleba. <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />Higinilu sunia nini labea holobagasimo, Godehe nine libo aeaba ofolo. Ehe nine libo aeaba ufuluguba, idele inolo noolo higini nonoba disimo, ninida ili sagoba ofelesia, ine libo aeaba homesine aulu.<verse eid="2CO 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:19">Sng 34.19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, naga Yesu Keliso dulumo ninida ua wasigaaba dibia labe amoguba, nine liboda, Yesu Kelisofea alefasia, aubasu aeaba wasigaaba ofolaba labe. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Hilibaisi daalu inolo nini naga disu ewemo, Kolidi gine libo aeaba mesesi aufe. Aufia, Godehe gili obegeba gasiba dimesine, nini naga auba disu. Gode Ehe, nine libo aeaba ofelefemo, gilida gine libo aeaba mesesi aufe. Libo aeaba ofolo mana amone kiwimo, fefedelu labe. Aulugulu, higinilumo, ninifea holobagaloguba, gilifeada holobagasi, gili kiwi sanefia afelesiale miliyobafe. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Gili auba kiwi diabia daaba miliyobafeba, ninimo <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasiba</char> lolu. Nini auba yasifia ligia, gili gelebaiyobafaleba sagilibale lolu. Enebamo, nini eweguba asigisu. Gili ninidai naga dilofealo ami dafifia labeguba, gili libo aeaba ofolofealo amida, ninidai aubasu dafifia miliyobafe.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:23">HD 19.23</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:32">1Kld 15.32</ref></char>
    </note>Nelewodali, nanodali, doma. Higinilu bule ninihe Asia helea sigia dulumo, gili fadaba asigimesi saeyobasu. Higinilu amo bule holobagasi, ninihe amo suniaeyodoluale alolugulu, higinilu amohe nini dufa olaeyobafeba keleba asigilu. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Seale, higinilu amohe ninifea auba holobagasi, nini dufa olaeyofealo ami loluba hiliselu. Higinilu amo ninifea holobagalumo, ninihe nine kiwifea anifia melesiale, Godene kiwifeasu anifia melesine holobagalu. Danelumo <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba ifolo</char> Gode, amo E.<verse eid="2CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TI 4:18">2Dim 4.18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Higinilu bule duliya amimo, nini dufa olaeyo aloluso, Godehe nini gasiba dafelagoso. Aufia, dufia, nini saabia no nafulu mesesi, Ehe ninimo aubasu sububa dafelagoyobafe. Aulune, Ehe hilia sunia nini sagoba ofolabiasu maiyobafeba, nini <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasiba</char> lolu. <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />Godehe nini sagoba homesifia, gilihe Edai sulu selaba labeba asigisu. Auba molosimo, idele inolo wedinalehe <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selaba</char> labe amo alefasia, Ehe nini sagoba ufulu. Ausi, Gode ninifea sagoba ofelefeba solu dobelesia, idele inolo wedinale ilihe Godefea bule heneyobafe.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folo e Kolidi ili labea daaluale amone solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Aga nini kaiiba selesiamo, hilia sunia, ninihe mana isolusu idele inolo suniafea mololo. Seale, mana mololumo ulufaba ofelesia, Godene si saabiamo, asigi aidaba ofelesiale mololu. Nine <char style="w" lemma="Asigi nafulune si">asigi nafulune simo</char>, nini nafulu molosuba asigifegulu, nini henesu. Ninimo, helefealune dawalolu amone kuliba daaluale. Aubale, ninimo Godene <char style="w">kanululo</char> mana amone kuliba abia mololu. Idele inolo noolofeasu auba mololuale, gilifea kolebada auba mololu. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.13-14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:12">2Kld 5.12</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:16">Fil 2.16</ref></char></note>Nini gilifea sowi seleba mesiamo, sulu gili alegaeyodolualeda, fadaba asigiba dialeda, seleba melale. Aubale. Nini seleba mesiamo, gili nine sulu amone kiwi sisa fadaba diba samodomesi, hamesia seleba melo. <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />Ninihe gilifea samini solu amo, gilihe haisi haisiba asigiba duluso, dufiamo, gili sunia fadaba asigiba dimesi hamefe. Auba ausi, nine Saminilo Yesune hilia amimo, ninihe gilifea henesia kaiiyobafeguba, gilida ninifea aubasu kaiiyobafe.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Auba moloyobafeba fadaba asigisia, na gili babiyo miyone madeneba ufulu. Na gili labea miyomo, fogo ule amosuale, fogo aida gili henemesi miyo hamelu. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Na daiyalumo eweguba ufia alolu. Maugabamo, gine sidi amidale inigia, amifia <char style="w">Masedonia</char> ami maiyo hiliselu. Aufia, Masedoniafia obegeba inigiamo, haiba gili labea miyoba daiyaba ufulu. Aufia, na gili labea alefasiamo, na Yudia obegeba maiyone, gilihe na sagoba ofelesia, ami hilibaimesi, na auba daiyaba ufulu. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Auluso, na daiyalu amo dedegesia afolu. Na auba dedegelumone, gili na gegelo inolobuba hilisefela? Auba hilisemabiyo. Helefealu inolo daiyasia, ilihe ee, moloyobafeba sodoso, aa, moloyobafaleba ado. Na-mo, auba gegeba sodoguba aulale.<verse eid="2CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Auluso, Godehe Ene sulumo hilia sunia afelesiale, fedoba sefia adoguba, ninida aubasu, nine sulu kuliba abia, eeba selesenaga, amo “Aa, seale moloyaleba” hiliseba ligia sodale. Aubale. Eeba selesenaga, eeba selefe amone moloyobafe. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">HD 18.5</ref></char></note>Nada, Saeleseda, <char style="w" lemma="Dimodi">Dimodida</char>, ninihe gilifeamo Godene faibe Yesu Keliso amone solu. Yesu Keliso amo Ehe, sulu aidaba sodale. Aubale. Hilia sunia Ehe “Ee-basu” sodo. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:14">MUU 3.14</ref></char></note>Gode selesia, “Ee, moloyoba” oloba huliale sulu selabia mulu amomo, Yesu Kelisohe sunia liliba samodolu. Aulugulu, Yesufea alefasia, ninihe Gode wabialesiamo, selesia, “Ee, <char style="sls"><char style="w">Amen</char></char>, seale auba moloyobafeba” selesu.<verse eid="2CO 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Gode Ehe gilida, ninida, Kelisofea kuliba ofasia, kiwigaafia kalugaamesi moloba ufulu. Aufia, Ehe ninimo Ene-ba iminiyosia, walea hano inolone gunia sagaba seloguba, Ene Asubane ninifea sagaba selu. <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:13-14">Efe 1.13-14</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 5:5">2Kld 5.5</ref></char></note> Auba molosia, Ehe ninimo Ene kolebaba enaolu. Ehe Ene Asubane nine libo usu ama diba ofelesia melumo, haisi noolo dufia meyobafesia, ninifea melu.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folo e Kolidi abiale, sowisu seleba melu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Nahe Godene si saabiamo, gilifea seale koleba aiiba eweguba selesu. Kolidi gili labea ugi na mulualemo, nahe keleba hiliselu amo gilifea ufiyalefia aulu. Na mulubiaga, na gilifea sulu kolelu saeyo alebaiyo. Na auba moloyo hamesiale, na miyomo afolu. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 5:3">1Fid 5.3</ref></char></note>Gine <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> alefasia, kiwigaafia labegulu, ninihe gine asigi ule ufulumo uluba adesia, lasiasia yasiyone selesuale. Aubale. Gili nafulu heneba mesesi, ninihe gilidai dabalu ami ua molosu.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 4:21">1Kld 4.21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, gine libo saabia no higinilosiba hiliselugulu, na miyomo afolu. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Enebamo, nahe gine libo higinimesi molosunaga, na-da heneba ufiyo uleno male miliyobafe. Gili miliyobafe, amo seale, auluso, gine libo higinilu ligia, gili na heneba ufiyodoluale alebaiye. <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Sowi na samini gilifea seleba mebailu ogo, mau ewe alefasia mebailu. Gili aso ne libo higiniba ufia labi, na mialeba hiliselu. Ne liboda heneba ofolo idele inolomo, gili koleba. Auluso, na mulubiaga, gilihe ne libo higiniba ofaiye. Auba aumesialene, na sowi amodale seleba mebailu. Sowi amo alegafasia, gili gine sese aleba ami, kegele isomesifia mebailu. Enebamo, na hilisebu, ne henelomone mauda, gine henelomone mauda, ule hamagane koleba. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:31">HD 20.31</ref></char></note>Sowi ogo, na gilifea samini seleba mebailumo, ne libo usu bule keleba hilisefia, higiniba ligia, si hano wedinale daaba labi, selelu. Auluso, na gine libo ogo higinimesi seleluale. Aubale. Na sowi ogo selelumo, gilihe na gilidai bule koleba hamesebuba asigimesi, seleba mebailu.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolohe heleba mololu amo hamasia heesia galimale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Doma. Maugaba liboda higiniba ufulu inolo amo ehe, na-su higiniba ufuluale. Aubale. Ehe gili suniafeada wedino libo higiniba ufulu. Sulu wedinoba na iwi selesumo, muguba ofelesia selesu. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Gili aleba ami, inolo bule wedinalehe, efea mana solu amo, isobu. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Aufia, aga e-mo bule keleba hilisesia, ene asigi ule ufulumo afa anosi, gilihe wolu e mololu amo waagi hamalesia, efea kanuluba homale. Aufia, e uluba disia, ene libo aeaba homale. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Auba isofasiamo, gilihe hameselo manamo, efea saabia molomalesu.<verse eid="2CO 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Sowi samini na selelu ogomo, gilihe ne sulu amo sunia kuliba maiyobafebileba dedeba babiyone selelu. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Gilihe efea kanuluba ofelesia, ene wolumo hamasia heesia galisenaga, nada efea kanuluba ofelesia, wolu halagulu mololumo hamasia heesia galisu. Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> si saabia ligiamo, gili sagoba ofelesia, na auba molosu. <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:31">Lug 22.31</ref></char></note> Enebamo, <char style="w" lemma="Sedene">Sedenehe</char> mana wolu mololabia anomo, nini asigiba dulugulu, ehe nini gegesiamo e kaamo adosine, ninihe no anogone wolumo hamasia heesia galisu.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nini Yesufea kulifia adesi kaamo miliyobafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 14:27">HD 14.27</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 16:9">1Kld 16.9</ref></char>
    </note>Na Kelisone awalu sulu nafulu saeyone, Dolase dauno ami goasimo, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> na dabalu ewe molomesi eno sogoba ufulu. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:1">HD 20.1</ref></char></note>Auluso, nelewo <char style="w" lemma="Daidasa">Daidasa</char> ene misimo ami besabale baafia, na keleba hiliselu bule alolugulu, nahe Dolase idele inolofea hawiyoba saafia, Daidasa isaeyone <char style="w">Masedonia</char> maiyone daalu.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Nini Godefea henelu buleba selesu. Maumo, Yesu Keliso kaamo alefasia, henesia ibaba diasilabia, saminiba aafe. Godehe ninida Yesudai auba henelabia kuliba milesi, uluba dibia aafe. Nini Yesu hiliseba asigiba lolumo alefasia, Ene kasine nine domala heeba ofologuba, ninida aafea ami, Ene kasineda hele sunia dedaleba yaafe. Godehe nini auba molomesi mololumone, nini Efea henesu. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15-16" />Seale, idele inolo suniahe Kelisone kasine domesine, ninimo Godefea alefasia, Ene kasine nafulu lolu. Idele inolo afiyo alebaibu ilihe, kasine amo dobelesi, ili olalomone kasine dobelesia, olalofealo maiyobafe. Auluso, idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba obegeba diyo</char> alebaibu ilihe, kasine amo dobelesi, miliyolumone kasine dobelesia, miliyolufealo maiyobafe. Dabalu amogulu moloyodolumo, abe ilililubi?<verse eid="2CO 2:15-16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Inolo noolohe Godene sulu mana amofea mole huliane dibaiyesia, magede elegelo inolo amogulu adesia, Godene sulu mana walelabia siba labe. Auluso, ninimo aubale. Godehe nini dabalu ewe molomesi iminifia hilibailugulu, ninimo Yesu Kelisofea helegeba ligia, Godene si saabiamo, Ene sulu walesiamo, asigi aidaba ligiale walelo.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Godehe oloba huliale dabalu hili mololu amohe, amakelelumone suniafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 5:12">2Kld 5.12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:27">HD 18.27</ref></char>
    </note>Ninihe sulu selesu ewemo, gilihe nini isolu inoloba bamesi gilifea hahanoba selesuale. Inolo noolohe fadaba bamesi sowi selelu dibia ano. Aulugulu, fadaba bamesi sowi selelu amogulu uleno, ninihe gilifea waleyobile? Me noolohe fadaba bamesi, gilifea sowi amogulu seleba homafasia, nini dibia maiyobile? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:2">1Kld 9.2</ref></char></note>Aubale. Gine gilimo, nine sowi selelugulu nine libo usu seleba dobu. Idele inolo suniahe amo alegafia, fadaba eloba babiyobafe. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:12">Kis 24.12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:33">Jer 31.33</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:26-27">Ese 36.26-27</ref></char></note>Nini dabalu mololu amo alefasia, gili asigi ule ufiyomo ami holobagalugulu, gilimo <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisofeafia</char> sowi selelu mulu amogulu labe. Sowi ewe seleba ofelesiamo, benene ibi seleba ufuluale. Aubale. Bebea miliyoluda labe Gode Ene Asubane seleba ufulu. Sowi ewe abane balelefea seleba ufuluale.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mosesene sulu muguli amo abane balelefea seleba ufulu. (Kis 24.12)</char></note> Aubale. Idele inolo bebea labene libo usu ami, seleba ufulu dobu.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Sulu ewene maumo, ewe. Ninihe Godene si saabiamo, Yesu Kelisofea alefasia dabalu moloba lolu. Aulugulu, Godehe Ene dabalumo nafulusu holobagaba ofoloba hilisesia, nini kiwigaaba kalugaasu. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Seale koleba, dabalu amo, nine kiwihe mololuba saeyodoluale koleba. Enebamo, nine ninihe dabalu ewe moloyodolu amone ilililuale lolu. Aubale. Godehe nini dabalu ewe molomesine ililiba moloba ufulu. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31">Jer 31.31</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:25">1Kld 11.25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:63">Yon 6.63</ref></char></note>Seale, Gode Ene alefasia ninimo, Ene <char style="w">oloba huliale dabalu</char> hili amo isoba molomesi, ililiba moloba ufulu. Oloba huliale dabalu amakelelumo, sulu muguli amo seleba ufulu dobu. Auluso, hilimo, seleba ufuluale dobu. Aubale. Oloba huliale dabalu hili aga molofe ewemo, Asubane Ene dabalu. Sulu muguli seleba ufulu amohe, idele inolo dufa olalo. Auluso, Asubane Ehe, idele inolofea bebea melesi miliyolu melo.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 34:29">Kis 34.29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Asigima. Godehe sulu muguli abanefea imini seleba ofasia, <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesefea</char> melu. Aufia, idele inolohe sulu muguli amo kuliba aasalenaga, sulu muguli amohe, ili amo olaeyone enofealo uluba dibia daalu. Godehe sulu muguli ami diba ofelesimo, Ene <char style="w">elalelu</char> nokenedai dibia holobagalu. Ausi, Mosese ene olegida elalelu nokene koleba fofagesi, <char style="w">Isolaele</char> idele inolo ilihe ene olegi si galiba babiyodoluale alolu. Aufia dufiamo, elalelu amo hamagi asigilelu. <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />Olaeyofealo uluba dibia ano sulu muguli amohe, elalelu amogulu holobagamesi moloba ufiyodolunaga, amo Asubanene dabalu amone elalelumo bule fofageyobafe. Amohe amakelumone elalelumo wasolu miliyobafe koleba.<verse eid="2CO 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 27:26">Lo 27.26</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:17">Lom 1.17</ref></char>
    </note>Sulu muguli amone dabalumo idele inolo fadaasia hodobaiyo aloluso, Gode Ene elalelumo ami aso alolu. Aulugulu, asigima. Dabalu hili ewehe, idele inoloda isolu melesine eno uluba dibia aafe amo, ene elalelumo, bule bule wasolu koleba labe. <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Godehe oloba huliale dabalu hili mololu ewe, elalelu bule bule koleba holobagalu amomo, dabalu amakele mololu amone elalelumo wasolu adesia, fofagelu koleba. Hilimo aga auba koleba fofagesi, amakelelumo asigilelu besabe. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Elalelumo Mosesene olegifea holobagalu amo asigilelugulu, sulu muguli amone dabalu amoda, asigilelo kegele. Auluso, Asubanene dabalumo asigilelale koleba. Asigima. Asigilelo kegele elalelu buledai holobagalunaga, asigilelale kegele amone elalelu bule bule koleba fofageba labe.<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Aulugulu, ninihe elalelu auba fofageyobafeba <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasiba</char> lolugulu, ninimo sagilisiale, ulufa kiwigaafia kalugaafia lolu. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:33">Kis 34.33</ref></char></note>Ninihe Mosese mololuguba mololale. Elalelu ene olegia ufulumo aso asigilebale labimo, Isolaele idele inolo ilihe asigilelo elalelu ewe asigilefeba bolosifia, ehe fagulo haisi no difasia, ene olegimo haguba ufulu. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Ausi, Isolaele idele inolo ine asigimo kaaba dafia alolu. Ausi, hilia amifia inigia agada, ilihe oloba huliale dabalu amakele mololu amone sulu alegasimo, fagulo hamagahe, sulu amone kiwi sisamo aso haguba ufiasu dobu. Fagulo ogo aso diba dafuluale dobu. Kelisofea asigi ule ofelesi, amisu diba dafiyobafe. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Seale, saminifia inigia, aga iwida, Mosesene sulu muguli selelu amo alegasimo, ine libomo fagulo haguba ufulugulu alolune, ilimo nafuluba babiyale adefe.<verse eid="2CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 34:34">Kis 34.34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, idele inolo abehe <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilofea</char> nolofia besisimo, ine libofea fagulo haguba dobumo diba dafolo. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:36">Yon 8.36</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:2">Lom 8.2</ref></char></note>Nahe lagi Saminiloba selesenaga, amo na Asubaneba amone iminiba selesu. Enebamo, Saminilone Asubanemo inolo ulenofea adesenaga, amo kegele ulenohe inolo amo haguba ufuluale dobu. Aubale. Inolo amo beega labe. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Aulugulu, nini sunia olegi haguba ufulumone fagulo amomo diba dafulu lolugulu, Saminilone elalelu ninifea miliyo saabimo, ninimo hewogulu adesia, elalelu amohe idele inolo noolofea neeba doweba labe. Elalelu kolelu amomo Saminilofeafia saabe. Elalelu amohe nini dedegeba ofolabasu ligia, ninimo Saminilone mimisililu melesi gadefalabia aafe. Saminilo E-mo Asubane labene, Ehe auba moloba labe.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Godene kiwigagalumo asigi uleda ufulu idele inolo ine miliyolu usu neeba labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Godehe ninimo <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanulusia</char>, dabalu ewe ninifea melu. Aulugulu, nini bonesia kiwi sanelale. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 2:17">2Kld 2.17</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 2:5">1Des 2.5</ref></char></note>Aubale. Ninimo yuaeyodolu kegele molobale ligia, muguba mololo mana faiso melu. Ninihe sulu selesiamo, yogoleba daafa gegeba sulu sodale. Aufia, ninihe Godene sulu mana no dedegeba sodale. Aubale. Ninihe seale sulumo ulufaba dafa walelo. Idele inolohe nine manamo ulufaba baafia osolamesi walesu. Aufia, ine <char style="w">asigi nafulune si</char> amohe, ninimo Godene si saabia mana isolu waleba labeba fadaba babiyobafe. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Aufia, idele inolo abehe, awalu sulu nafulu nini walesu ewene nafuluba fadaba asigiba difalemo, ine asigimo fagulo haguba ufulu amogulu labe. Idele inolo ili amomo afiyo alebaibu. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:2">Efe 2.2</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:15">Kol 1.15</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:3">Hib 1.3</ref></char></note>Ili asigi ule ofale kakainabu. Maumo, Sedene, hilia fogo aga eweda yasiba labemone gode ehe, ine asigimo gasiagusia, kakaba dafaliba labe. E auba ausiamo, ilihe yane awalu sulu nafulufeafia neefe amo bolosifia aufe. Godene mimisililu <char style="w">Keliso</char> E-mo, Ene awalu sulu nafulu amofeafia yane <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">elalelumo</char> neeba labe.<verse eid="2CO 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Doma. Ninihe walesiamo, nine mana mololomone wi digiba walelale. Aubale. Sulu nini walelomo ewe. “Yesu Keliso E-mo, <char style="w">Saminilo</char> labe. Aulune, ninihe Ene sulu kuliba abia, ninimo gine dabalu mololo inolo lolu.” <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:3">Stt 1.3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Ais 9.2</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 3:18">2Kld 3.18</ref></char></note>Samini koleba Gode selesia, <char style="qt">nigili gagaiya amifia yane neeba dowemaba solu</char>. Auba molomaba solu E hamagasu, nine libo usu yane neeba dowemalu. Gode auba ausimo, Ehe nini Ene elalelumo bafasia asigimesi aufe. Ene elalelu amo Yesu Kelisone olegiafia fofagesi, nine miliyolu usumo yane neeba ofelefe.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 5:1">2Kld 5.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Godene elalelu nine libo usu neeba dowefe amomo, beleme yogolelu saeyodoluale koleba. Auluso, nine domalamo, beleme amoda usu sela ami, gofo hele mololugulu, alebale gaselelo labe. Amo nafulu. Enebamo, amo alefasia nini eweguba hilisebu. Gofo hele mololu kiwidaleguba, ninida kiwidale lolu. Aulune, kiwigagalu bule, nini nine miliyo abulu amo, nine ninifea alefasia holobagalale. Aubale. Kiwi amo Godefea alefasia mulu koleba. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:8">2Kld 1.8</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 7:5">7.5</ref></char></note>Godene kiwigagalumo, nine miliyolu usu labe amo, nini eweguba eloba bosolu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CO 4:8" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 4:8">Higinilu nonoba nini aleba holobagagaba labeso,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CO 4:8">higinilu amohe nini dufa dafogolale.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 4:8">Kegele wedinalehe nine asigi dabagalaba ofoloso,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CO 4:8">nine asigimo sunia woba ofolale.<verse eid="2CO 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />Gisa inolohe ninifea aiba gasalabia aafeso,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CO 4:9">Godehe nini afelesiale labi, nini ninibisu adale.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 4:9">Inolo noolohe nini helea dufa dafogofeso,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CO 4:9">nini sunia woba dafelesia dufa olaluale.<verse eid="2CO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 15:31">1Kld 15.31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nine domala auba naga diabia sisiamo, ninihe Yesu naga difasia, olaluba ulufaba walefe. Ausi, Yesune miliyolu amoda, nine domala usufeafia ulufaba walefe. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:36">Lom 8.36</ref></char></note>Inolo noolohe Yesu dufa olalugulu, nini aso bebea sigia, Ene dabalu mololabia aafe ewe alefasia, ninida dufa olalugulu adefe. Auba ausimo, nine olaeyo domala ewefeamo, Yesune miliyolumo ulufaba walesia aufe. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Auba aulugulu, olalohe ninifea ene dabalu molosi, bebeahe gilifea dabalu moloba ado.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 116:10">Sng 116.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Godene bugo usu eweguba selelu dobu. “<char style="qt">Na Godefea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulune</char>, na sulu saaba dafelagolu.</char>” Nini hamagubasu Godefea asigi ule ufulune, ninida Godene sulu mana saaba dafelagoba lolu. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:14">1Kld 6.14</ref></char></note>Enebamo, nini eweguba asigife. Gode Saminilo Yesuda <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba ifolu</char> amo Ehe, nini Yesudai melesi degeba ifosimo, gilida nini galiba Ene olegia miliyo milesi ulubia miyobafe. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Kegele ninifea holobagafe ewemo, gili sagoba ofelesia, moloba labe. Gode Ene <char style="w">kanululo</char> mana amohe, idele inolo wedinale holobagalabia aasimo, idele inolo amohe Godefea henelu buleba selefe amone wasigasia, galeba dalesiamo, ilihe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">elalelumo</char> digife.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 3:16">Efe 3.16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, nini bonesia kiwi sanefale. Seale, nine domala bado saabialomo, woba dafelabia aafeso, hilia sunia, nine libo usu iligimo, Godehe miliyolu hili no hagagaeaba ofolabasu labe. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:17-18">Lom 8.17-18</ref></char></note>Higinilu aga nini diabia aafe ewemo, bulale. Hilia fogo bulale ufia miliyobafe. Seale, higinilu nini aga dife amohe, elalelu amo ninifea alefalu melesi gadefafe. Elalelu yogolelu amohe, higiniludeno nini aga dife amo waseba suniafia daalu labe. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:16">Kol 1.16</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, ninihe si besabe kegele amofea si galiba bisigiale, si besabale kegele amone si galiba babiyoba. Maumo, kegele aga nini besabe ewemo, fogo abobodeno ufia miliyobafe. Auluso, kegele si besabale ewemo, alefalu ufia miliyobafe.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Nini domala hili diyo amone yasisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 4:7">2Kld 4.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Enebamo, nini eweguba hilisebu. Nine domala ewemo, helefealu iwi seele molo dulu amogulu labe. Seele molo kiwidale ligia, fogo selale dulu adale. Aulugulu, idele inolo seele molo usu misiyone fogo abobodeno amosu ado. Amogubasu, nini helefealu iwi nine domala usu fogo abobo misiyobasu. Helefealune seele molo amo wosimo, ninimo molo no, Gode dulu labe amone diyobafe. Molo amomo, inolo sonehe duluale. Aubale. Domala hili amo <char style="w">hebene</char> lagi dobumone, alefalu miliyobafe. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:23">Lom 8.23</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, helefealu iwi nini seele molo amo usu ligia, higinilu disia, nini eweguba sogooba lolu. “Ne molo hili hebene lagi labe ami usu asebaiye!” Domala hagaea diyo amomo, Godehe ninifea fagulo kaaba ofologuba, kaaba ufiyobafe. <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />Mau enebamo, nini amo saligaba ofelesimo, abagudoa alolumo babiyobafale.<verse eid="2CO 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Nini seele molo helefealu dulu iwi aso sigiamo, higinilu diaba ligiamo, sogooba lolu. Maumo, nini domala amakelelumo, fagulo huba dafologuba, huba dafiyo hamefe. Auluso, nini domalada male miliyo hamefale. Enebamo, domalada male ligia, nini abagudoagulu babiyobafe. Auba hamefale. Aubale. Ninihe domala hili amone saabia saligabaiyeba hamelo. Ausi, domala bebea miliyoluda amohe, olalo domala amo gasiaguba dafelesi asigileyobafe. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Nini auba domala hili dimesimo, Godehe nini iminifia ami madeneba ufulu. Ehe kegele nafulu amo seale ninifea moloyobafebuba asigimesimo, Ene Asubane ninifea ama melu.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 11:13-16">Hib 11.13-16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba asigisia, nini hilia sunia, kiwigaaba kalugaafia lolu. Nini helefealu iwi, seele molo aseloguba, aso nine domala usu sigia, ninimo <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilodai</char> Ene helea aso sigialeso, Edai hago loluba asigibu. Auba asigisiamo, nini aso kiwigaaba kalugaafia lolu. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Enebamo, ninihe E auba aso si bisigiale, Efea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofalabia</char> daaba lolu. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 1:23">Fil 1.23</ref></char></note>Nini nine domala gadefia daafia, Saminilodai misiyo dabaiyeba hilisesiamo, nini aso helefealu iwi ligia, kiwigaaba kalugaafia lolu. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:10">Kol 1.10</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 4:1">1Des 4.1</ref></char></note>Nini nine domala usu aso iwi sigianagada, aufia helefealu domala ewe afasia, Saminilone helea sigianagada, hilia sunia, ninihe Saminilo hamefeguba heafuba moloba miliyoba. Amone miliyone, ninihe migagaba aasu. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 12:14">Sav 12.14</ref></char></note>Mau enebamo, nini hilisebu. Idele inolo suniamo, <char style="w">Keliso</char> ene osolaeyone ailaiya yoba saabea olegia ami kalugaeyobafe. Aufia, nini domala usu iwi aso sigia, mana nafulu mololunagada, me mana wolu mololunagada, nini suniahe, elebi elebiba mana mololu amoguba elebe diyobafe.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ninihe idele inolo Godedai hilise ule melesimo dabalu moloyo dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Nini Saminilo baaba sagilisiamo, E sisa ado. Aulugulu, ninihe idele inolo ine asigi sigiba molaeyosia waleba ado. Godehe inolo nini ewegulubamo, fadaba asigifia labe. Aulugulu, na hamesiamo, gilihe ninimo aubada fadaba asigimesi hamefe. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Nini aga sulu selesu ewemo, gilihe ninimo isolu inoloba bamesi hahanosia, nine meleba kaiisia selesuale. Aubale. Auluso, gili ninimone kaiimesi selesu. Enebamo, inolo noolohe libo usu molofemo bolale ligia, bado saabiasu bisigia, no anogo osolaba bolo. Ilihe ine meleba osolasia kaiisia, ine wi digilo. Gilihe inolo ili amoguludai nini saaba sulu selaba ligia, ninimone heneba kaiiba sulu samesine, nini gilifea fogo mesu. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Nini Godene Asubane alefasia, kagoalugulu besabenaga, nini Godene dabalu moloba ligia, auba lolu. Auluso, nini dawalolu inologulu besabenaga, nini gine dabalu moloba ligia, auba lolu. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Enebamo, Yesu Kelisone hameselohe nini uluba dibia sife. Aulune, nini eweguba asigiba lolu. Suniane fogo disia, inolo ulenohe ili amone alibiasia olalu. Auba aulune, eweguba besabe, ili sunia olaba yaalu labe. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:7-8">Lom 14.7-8</ref></char></note>Ehe nini suniane alibiasia olasiamo, nini aso haiba no nineba melesifia olaluale. Aubale, ninimo Ene-ba melesifia, Ehe nine fogo disia olalu. Auba olasi, Godehe E <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba ifolu</char>.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Aulugulu, nini no anogo osolasiamo, helefealu idele inolo si bafasia osolaloguba, saabia no amoguba osolalale. Seale, saminimo, ninihe helefealu mana kuliba abia, Keliso osolaba bisigiamo, E balu helefealu inolo alolububa hiliselu. Auluso, aga aubada saabia no hilisebuale. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:1">Lom 8.1</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 6:15">Gal 6.15</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, idele inolo abehe, Kelisodai kulifia labenaga, amo hili moloba dafelagolu labe. Amakelelumo afelesi, hili holobagalu labe. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:10">Lom 5.10</ref></char></note>Gode Ene alefasia, kegele amo sunia holobagafe. Nini saminimo Ene gisa aloluso, Ehe Kelisofea alefasia, ninimo Enedai hilise ule melesi seloaba ufulu. Aufia, idele inolo nooloda Edai hilise ule melesine, Ehe seloaba ofolone dabalu amo ninifea molomesi melu. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:23-25">Lom 3.23-25</ref></char></note>Seloaba ufiyo sulumo ewe. Keliso dabalu mololu amofea alefasia, Godehe helefealu idele inolo Edai hilise ule melesi seloaba ufulu. Helefealu idele inolo wolu sunia ili mololumo, Ehe alegasia, ilifea sabe moloba obegelale. Aufia, seloaba ofelesia, idele inolo Edai hilise ule melesine, sulu amone saeyo dabalumo, Godehe ninifea melu. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Dabalu ninifea auba melumo alefasia, nini Kelisone mofeyo adesu. Gode Ene Ehe, nine mofeyo koleba alefasia, gilifea kiwigaaba selefeguba, nini gilifea Kelisone wi alefasia, eweguba susiba selesu. “Wae, gili koleba, Godehe gili Edai seloaba ufiyone, Efea waagi fogo memale!”<figure style="fig" alt="Paul teaching" file="44_Ac_17_15_RG.jpg" size="col" loc="2Co 5:20" copy="Sweet Publishing" ref="5.19-21">Folo e Yesu Kelisone mofeyo ligia, sulu mana walefe.</figure> <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:15">Hib 4.15</ref></char></note>Keliso Efea <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> ulenoda male koleba. Auluso, Godehe nini sagoba ufiyo hamesia, nine wolumo sunia E saabia diba ufulu. Ausi, Keliso E wolu koleba alolu. Godehe auba mololumo, nini Kelisofea kulifia ligia, Ene isolu idele inolo melesifia aulu.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Nini Godedai ua dabalu moloba ligiamo, sulu eweda gilifea kiwigaaba selesu. “Godene <char style="w">kanululo</char> amo, gili dulu alebaibu. Aulugulu, kegele nafulu gili dulu amo weaselosi.” <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:8">Ais 49.8</ref></char></note>Aubale. Enebamo, Gode Ene bugohe seleba dobumo ewe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CO 6:2" />
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">
    <char style="qt">“Nafulu hilia adesi, gilihe Na wesimo, Na dubulu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, Nahe gili <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> obegeba diyone hilia adesi, Na gili sagoba ufulu.”</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CO 6:2" />
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Gili doma. Godene hilia nafulu kolebamo aga adefe ewe. Aufia, gili gasiba dafelagoba obegeba diyone hilia amoda, aga adefe ewe.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folo dabalu kolelu mololu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Nini alefasia idele inolohe, nine dabalu molofe ewene lasiaba saaba, sulu wolu ulenoda samesiale hamefe. Aulune, inolo ulenoda ene emo gadamesialesia, ninihe kegele ulenoda idele inolo aafea ami diba ofolale. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Aubale. Idele inolo suniahe, nini Godene dabalu mololo loluba asigimesine, mana nini walesiamo, Godene dabalu mololo adogulu walelu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CO 6:4" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 6:4">Ausiane, kegele halagulu holobagasimoda,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CO 6:4">nini kiwi sanefia afiyale lolu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 6:4">Higinilu nokene nokeneba holobagasida,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 6:4">Noolohe nini egedidiba woba molosida,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 6:4">Nini amaleba galilu dedeleiya ami labida,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CO 6:4">nini kiwi sanefia afiyale lolu.<verse eid="2CO 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 11:23-27">2Kld 11.23-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, noolohe nini dufelesida,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 6:5">Nini dibolo dafogosida,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 6:5">Hegoba galiba wuaaba selaba adesida,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CO 6:5">nini kiwi sanefia afiyale lolu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 6:5">Aufia, nini hogololu dabalu moloba ligiada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 6:5">Nigiliba noolo hanebale ligiada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 6:5">Naiyo nabale mamiaba labida,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CO 6:5">nini kiwi sanefia afelesiale ado.<verse eid="2CO 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 4:12">1Dim 4.12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nini mana nafulu galagololu mololo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2CO 6:6">Asigi nafuludai ligia koleba osolalo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2CO 6:6">Nini hamedofa ado.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2CO 6:6">Nini no anogofea mana nafulu heafuba mololo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2CO 6:6">Ninihe <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenene</char> kiwigagalumo dulu lolu.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2CO 6:6">Nini hamesesiamo, seale hamesesuba hameseba ado.<verse eid="2CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />Ninimo seale sulusu sodo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2CO 6:7">Aufia, nini Godene kiwigagalu alefasia dabalu mololo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="2CO 6:7">Ninihe isolu manamo, belaguyone kegelegulu, noolomo, nine sone inaloalofealo sefia, noolomo, sone fofonaloalofealo sefia, Godene dabalu ami mololo.<verse eid="2CO 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Inolo noolohe nine wi digisi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CO 6:8">noolohe nine wimo dufa dafogofe.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 6:8">Inolo noolohe nini lasiaba saaba woba selesi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CO 6:8">noolohe nini saaba nafuluba selefe.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 6:8">Inolo noolo selesia, ninimo masega sulu sodo gegelo inoloba selefe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CO 6:8">Auluso aubale, seale sulusu sodomo nini ewe.<verse eid="2CO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 4:10">2Kld 4.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nini bolale inolo wida malegulu loluso,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CO 6:9">nini bolo wida lolu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 6:9">Nini olaeyogulu adoso,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CO 6:9">nini bebea solu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 6:9">Ilihe nini mana soluso,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CO 6:9">nini aso dufa olaluale.<verse eid="2CO 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />Nini higiniba koleba adefea ami,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CO 6:10">hilia sunia nini henebasu ado.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 6:10">Aufia, nini weagulu inolo adefea ami,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CO 6:10">ninihe asubanefealomo idele inolo wedinale elebeda ufulu melesi moloba ofolo.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 6:10">Aufia, nini kegele ulenoda maleiya ami,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CO 6:10">nini kegele suniane biso lolu.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Gili Kolidi idele inolo, ninihe gilifea sulu muguba ofale, ulufaba dafa solu. Ninihe gilifea koleba hamesesia, nine libo sogoba dobu. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Nini gilifea hameseyomo, nine libo kaabuale. Auluso, gilihe gine libo ogo, gine kaafia labe. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:14">1Kld 4.14</ref></char></note>Aga na sulu selesu ewemo, enaohe ene faibefea sodoguba selesu. Nine libo bule sogoba ofelesu hamaguba, gilida sabe bedoba molosia, nini hameseyone, gine libo bule sogoba homale.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nini Godene sebele molo lolugulu, muuba kalilu miliyo dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:11">Efe 5.11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Asigi ule ufulu idele inolo gilihe, asigi ule ufuluale idele inolodai, ua i ikauloguba, ikaufia melabiyo. Mana isoludai, mana woludai ua gegoaba adale. Yanedai, nigiligagaludai, aalu aalifaba dafifia adale. <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" /><char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisodai</char>, Sedenedai,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ga Igilisi Baibolo alegasiamo, ga iwi wi Belialo babiyobafe. </char><char style="it">Belialo </char> wi amo, <char style="fq" closed="false">Sedene</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ne wi nomo amo. </char></note> aalu hilise ule adola? Inolo Kelisofea asigi ule ufuludai, inolo Kelisofea asigi ule ufulualedai, aalu hilise ule adola? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1Kld 3.16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:12">Wkp 26.12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:38">Jer 32.38</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:27">Ese 37.27</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:3">MUU 21.3</ref></char></note>Godene <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molodai</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Masega gode">masega godene</char> molodai, aalu ua gagaiyoba adola? Aubale koleba. Ninimo, Gode bebea labe amone sebele molo lolu. Godehe samini eweguba saaba ufulu,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CO 6:16" />
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">
    <char style="qt">“Na ili aleba ami sigia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">
    <char style="qt">Na ili galiba siba miliyo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">
    <char style="qt">Na ine Gode labi,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">
    <char style="qt">ilimo Ne mosomu idele inolo miliyobafe.”</char><verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 52:11">Ais 52.11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:4">MUU 18.4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:34">Ese 20.34</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 20:41">41</ref></char>
    </note>Aulugulu, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> sulu no eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CO 6:17" />
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">
    <char style="qt">“Gilihe asigi ule ufuluale idele inolodai ua gegoabale,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">
    <char style="qt">ili gadefia, fela milibaima.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">
    <char style="qt">Kegele nugumalu aiyalu dobu amo, ulenoda gili gemabiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">
    <char style="qt">Ausimo, Nene Nahe gili ami diba diyo.”</char><verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 7:14">2Sml 7.14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:9">Jer 31.9</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, E sulu no eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CO 6:18" />
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:18">
    <char style="qt">“Na gine Gao labi, gilimo Ne faibilidali, Ne nelewelidali miliyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:18">
    <char style="qt">Kiwigagalu suniane wasolu labe Gode Saminilo, Nahe auba selesu.”</char><verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Ne yagusodali koleba, oloba huliale sulu auba saaba ofolaba yaalu ewemo, aga nini dulu lolu. Aulugulu, nine domaladai, asubanedai, heesia, nugumalu melesi moloba labe kegele amo sunia diba dafalifia, galagololu miliyoba. Enebamo, nini Gode baaba sagilisia, E sisa ligia, Edai <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> miliyone moloba ofolabia daabasu miliyobafe.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kolidine sese idele inolo asigi besilumone, Folo e bule henelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Gine libo usu kaasiale, ninifea fogo memale. Ninihe inolo ulenofea mana isoluale mololuale. Ninihe inolo uleno woba dafuluale. Aufia, ninihe inolo uleno gegesia, ene kegelemo fa duluale. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Nahe gili heleba mololu amone fadaayosia selesuale. Aubale. Na selesiamo, saminida auba solumo, ninihe gili bule hamesebuba selesu. Nini aso sigianagada, me olasenagada, gilidai hameseba adabia daaba miliyo. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Na eweguba hilisebu. Na gilifea isoba ulufaba selesu, na sulu muguba ufiale koleba. Na gilifea bule koleba kaiiba adesia, ne libo aeaba ufulu koleba lolu. Amo alefasia, higinilu wedinale na labea holobagafia labinagada, henelo ne libo wasiga sauufe.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 2:13">2Kld 2.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nini dafasia, <char style="w">Masedonia</char> iwi sigiamo, nini halemane misiyo babealo. Aubale. Hele iwimo, higinilu nokene nokeneba nini labea holobagagabasu labeo. Inolo ilihe ninidai hegeba labeo. Ausi, nine libo hidigisia sagiliba alolu. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Auluso, Godehe idele inolo ine kiwi saabia anibale, helea adomo, ine libo aeaba ofelesia kiwigagaba ofolo. Aulugulu, Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Daidasa">Daidasa</char> nini labea hilibailu amo alefasia, nine libo aeaba ofeleso. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />Daidasa nini labea milifasia, ninifea gili saaba awaso. Auba awalu amoda, nine libo aeaba ofeleso. Enebamo, e gilidai sobele alolu amone eweguba ninifea awaso. Gili samini mololumone yagunagasia, yeesoso. Aufia, gili nadai hilise ule miliyosia babaiyesoso. Gili auba mololumo alefasia, ene libo aeaba ofelesoso. Aulugulu, na nokene henelu.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.8-9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 2:4">2Kld 2.4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Na hilisebu, sowi na samini seleba mebailu amohe, gine libo higinisia, gili yuaba ufulu. Saminimo, na amone keleba hiliseluso, gili fogo bulaledeno amosu libo higinilu alolu bisigia, na saabia no keleba hiliseluale. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Aubale. Na sowi ogo gilifea seleba mebailumone, aga henefia lolu. Gili sowi ogohe, libo higinilu alolumone na henelualeso, libo higinilu amofea alefasia, gili gine <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besifasia</char>, nololu. Amone na henelu. Seale, Godehe gili libo higinilu alolu ogomo difasia, gine miliyolu isomesine moloba ufulu. Aulugulu, nini sulu auba gilifea seleba mebailu amo alefasia, gili woba ufuluale koleba.<verse eid="2CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:3-5">Mad 27.3-5</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:16-17">Hib 12.16-17</ref></char>
    </note>Liboda higinilo helefealune mana amofea alefasia holobagalo amohe, olaeyo dibia ano. Auluso, liboda higinilo Godefea alefasia holobagalo amohe, idele inolo asigi besimesi moloba ofelesia, ili <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagolo</char>. Idele inolo asigi auba besilu amo, ili wolu auba mololu amone habosia, asigi haiba no dedegefia, wolu molofea ami obegeba maiyo hamefale.<verse eid="2CO 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Amo seale, bama. Gode alefasia gili libo higinimesi molofe amo alefasia, gilifea mana nafulu nokene nokeneba holobagamesi mololu. Aulugulu, na dobelesufalumo, gili mana helegeba molosoba awasi dubulu. Aufia, dobelesufalumo, heleba gili mololumo, gili fogaba selesoba awasi dubulu. Aufia, dobelesufalumo, gili wolu mololo amofea hidigifia, habosoba awasi dubulu. Aufia, dobelesufalumo, gili Gode baaba sagilisia, E sisa alebaiyesoba awasi dubulu. Aufia, na dobelesufalumo, gilihe helebada mololu inolo amo isoyone mana selesoba awasi dubulu. Seale, kegele ewene fealomo sunia ami, gili heleba ulenoda male aloluba walesoso.<verse eid="2CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Nahe sowi ogo samini seleba mesiamo, inolo helebada mololu amo hilisesia seleluale. Aufia, inolo ogone sonefeafia higiniluda dulu idele inolo amoda hilisesia, seleluale. Aubale. Maumo, Godene si saabia, gine gili bisigia, gili nineba mana nafulu helegeba molofeba fadaba bamesisia, nahe sowi ogo ami selelu. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Aulugulu, mana gili mololu amohe, nine libo aeaba ufulugulu, nini henesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Auluso, ewesuale. Gili suniahe Daidasane asigimo kiwigaaba ufulugulu, eda henefe amone bisigia, ninida henelu bule alolu. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Samini nahe Daidasafea gine mana nafulu amone selesia, kaiiba solu. Aufia, sulu na gili amone saaba solu amone na yualuale. Hilia sunia nahe gilifeamo, sulu sealesu sodo. Amogubasu, Daidasafea gili amone saaba kaiiba sulu solu amoda, seale koleba holobagalu. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Daidasa e gili labea saabimo, gili sagilisia bibilisia, e luba disia, ene sulu sunia dobelesia kuliba aasoso. E gili mana molofe amone obegeba asigisiamo, gilifea bule henesia, hameseba labeo. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Aulune, na gili hiliseba ligia, kegelefealo sunia ami keleba hiliseyalene, na henelu bule adesu.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Sigidubulu idele inolohe Yudia idele inolo sagoba ufiyone mole dibia gagaiyolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:26">Lom 15.26</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 9:1-2">2Kld 9.1-2</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, nelewodali, nanodali, aga kegele no selesumo ewe. Godehe <char style="w">Masedonia</char> <char style="w">sese</char> idele inolofea kanulufia, ili sagoba ufulu amone, gili fadaba asigimesi awaeyo hamesu. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Higinilu bule ili labea holobagagaba labi, ine libo dedeba besabeo. Auba ligia, ili weagulu ligia, kegele ulenoda male koleba labeo. Auluso, ili nokene henelu labene, ilihe ine seba alebale, wasiga sauusia mebasu labeo. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Mana ili mololumo, na si abulu amone, fadaba selesu. Ili mole ufulumo osolafia, haisi lilife amoguba iminifia mesiamo, suniaba waseba nooloda meso. Ili mololu amomo, noolohe ilifea mole homaba egedidiba selefale waaga, ine hamefeguba moloso.<verse eid="2CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />Seale, ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene idele inolo</char> Yelusalame ami kakainabu amo sagoba ufiyosia, ninifea susiba selesia, “Sese noolohe mole dibia gagaiyofia, Yelusalame mebaisimo, ninida ilidai ua waagi mole molaba dibia gagaiyomaleyobileba” seleso. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Ninihe ili imini wedino meyobafebuba hilisefia, bosolufalumo, ili imini amo nokene waseba mesi abulu. Ausi, ilihe Godene hame kuliba maiyofia, moleda dibia gagaiyofe dabalu amone ninifea sagoba ofeleso. Auba molosiamo, ilihe ine ilimo ninifea ulu meso. Auluso, olaibo kegele ewe, ilihe ine ilimo <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilofea</char> ulu meso.<verse eid="2CO 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Masedonia sese ili auba ausi, ninihe <char style="w" lemma="Daidasa">Daidasafea</char> gili aleba amida, mole dibia gagaiyomesi obegeba malalu. Samini, ehe gili aleba ami, dabalu amo moloyone maugalu. Aulugulu, ninihe efea amo aga moloba samodomalelu. Mole dibia gagaiyofe dabalu amone mau sisamo, kanulusia ulu melone dabalu. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:1-2">1Kld 16.1-2</ref></char></note>Gili kegele sunia molosiamo, mana nafulusu koleba mololo. Gine <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> amoda, gine sulu sodo amoda, gine asigilo amoda, mana isolu gili helegeba moloba ado amoda, ninidai hameselo mana amoda, gili koleba sunialu labe. Aulugulu, gili mana nafulu sunia ewe auba molosiamo, kanulusia ulu meyone dabalu eweda waseba suniaba molomale.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Gili auba molomalelu sulu sodoguba egedidiba selesuale. Aubale. Auluso, na auba selesiamo, Masedonia idele inolo ilihe mana nafulu walesia, helegeba meluba awasu. Ausiamo, nahe gili aubasu molomesine kiwigaaba ufiyo hilisefe. Amo alefasia, na gine hameselo mana sealelaba osolaba babiyobasu. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:20">Mad 8.20</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:6-7">Fil 2.6-7</ref></char></note>Enebamo, gilihe nine Saminilo Yesu <char style="w">Keliso</char> Ene <char style="w">kanululo</char> manamo asigiba dulu labe. E elebeda ufulu aloluso, E gili sagoba ufiyosia, elebeda ufulu alolumo afasia, weagulu inolo holobagalu. E auba weagulu alolu amohe, gili elebeda ufulu melesi aulu.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Mole dibia gagaiyoyo dabalu ewenemo, ne asigi dobuguba gilifea saaba mesu ewe. Hamu afolu anogomo, dabalu amofealomo, gili heda maugaba mololu. Enebamo, mole mebaiyesia, gili mole seale dibia gagaiyosia maugalu. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Aulugulu, aga gilihe dabalu ewe koleba samodomale. Samini gili heafuba ligia, maugaba mololu amoguba, elosiada aubasu heafuba ligia, moloba samodomale. Gili meyo ililibuguba memale. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 12:43-44">Mag 12.43-44</ref></char></note>Enebamo, mole bule digiada, wedino digiada, ga meyone heafusenaga, Godehe amone baafia heneyobafe. Ehe gafea, “Kegele ga male dobia amifia memaleba” sodale. Aubale. Kegele ga dobu amone difasia memesi hamefe.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Enebamo, idele inolo noolo anogo, gili alefasia sagoba ufulune, nafulu kakainabi, gili ginefealomo, abobolu ligia, higinilu sesenaga, amo nafuluale. Aubale. Nini sunia imini ule misiyo dobu. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Aga fogo ewemo, gili kegele wedinale dobugulu, gilihe idele inolo kegele male adefe ili amofea, sagoba homale. Aufia, dufia gili kegele male adesi, kegele ili dobimo, ilihe gilifeada sagoba ofelesia, gilifea meyobafe. Auba ausimo, nini mana imini ule molosia, nini sunia nafulusu misiyobafe. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:18">Kis 16.18</ref></char></note>Godene bugohe amone iminisia, sulu eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CO 8:15" />
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 8:15">
    <char style="qt">Inolo abehe, naiyo wedinaleda molaba gagaiyolu e-mo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 8:15">
    <char style="qt">weaseyone huliane afolu male.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 8:15">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, inolo wedinoda molaba gagaiyolu e-mo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 8:15">
    <char style="qt">e abobolu aloluale.</char><verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe inolo osoloa Kolidi ami hilibailu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Godehe <char style="w" lemma="Daidasa">Daidasane</char> asigimo degeba ifolugulu, nahe gili sagoba ufiyo hilisefe amogubamo, eda gili sagoba ufiyone helegeba labeo. Aulugulu, nahe Godefeamo wisoba selesu. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Enebamo, ninihe e-mo gili labea malalesia, bosolufalumo, e gili labea maiyone, ene e daiyaba labi abulu. Aulugulu, nini efea malalesi, henesia eeso. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Auba ausi, ninihe keliso inolo elewo no, Daidasa galiba malesi hilibaisu. Elewo amohe, awalu sulu nafulu nokene sodogulu, <char style="w">sese</char> sunia ilihe, e dabalu nafulu mololuba ulufaba saaba dafelagoba ado. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Aufia amosuale. Sese sunia ilihe, elewo amo iminisia, nini galiba Yelusalame ami abiamo, mole dibia gagaiyolumo agifia malalelu. Nini mole gagaiyosiamo, hameselo mana alefasia, noolo anogo sagoba ufiyofia heafuba dibia gagaiyoluba walesu. Amofea alefasia, nini Saminilone wi digisu. <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Ili mole bule nine sone saabia ofelesi, uluba miliyobafe ewene, inolo ulenohe ninifea woba samesi hamefale. Auba sodosine, nelewo amo nini galiba maiyobafemo, nafulu koleba. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Ninihe mana isolusu moloyo asigilo. Mana isolu moloyo amo, Saminilone si saabia amosuale. Idele inolone si saabiada, mana isolusu moloyo hamefe.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Aufia, ninihe aga Daidasada, nelewo ogoda gili labea hilibaisiamo, nelewo noda aaludai malesi hilibaisu. Ninihe inolo ewe dabalu nokene nokeneba molomesi dedeba besabi, e hilia sunia dabalu helegeba molosia, suniaba moloba adeso. Inolo ewehe hilisesia, gili mana nafulu moloyobafeba asigisia, aga e gili aleba ami, dabalu moloyone bule hameso. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Aulugulu, ninihe inolo osoloa gili labea hilibaisumo, ewe. Agelemo, Daidasa. E ne sama ligia, gili sagoba ofelesia, dabalu ua moloyone, nadai dafifia labe. Elewo aida nomo, sese iwi kakainabu amohe, aalu gadefafasia, gili labea ami Kelisone wi digimesine hilibaiso. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 7:13-14">2Kld 7.13-14</ref></char></note>Auba aulugulu, gilimo inolo osoloa ewe heafuba uluba dima. Ausimo, gilihe sese suniane si saabiamo, gine hameselo mana auba sawaba waleyobafe. Ausenaga, ninihe ilifea gili saaba kaiiba sulu solumo, balu weaseyobafale.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Yelusalame idele inolo sagoba ufiyofia mole dibia gagaiyomaleba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 8:1-7">2Kld 8.1-7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene idele inolo</char> sagoba ufiyone mole gagaiyoyomo gili ama asigibu. Aulune, na kegele amone saabia saeyone, dabalu no malebuba asigisu. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Enebamo, mole ewe gagaiyofea ami, gili noolo anogofea sagoba ofaiyeba labeba, na asigibu. Aulugulu, nahe Masedonia idele inolofea gili saaba selesiamo, na gine wi kaiisia digilu. Nahe ilifea sulu eweguba solu, “Idele inolo <char style="w">Akaea</char> helea ami kakainabu ili amohe,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Idele inolo Akaea helea ami kakainabu ili amo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selesiamo, Folohe Kolidi sese idele inolo iminife. Enebamo, Kolidi sidi amo Akaea fogoba asuluiya ami labe. Lomene gamane yasiba ada amone hele bule aleba ami, ulenomo, Akaea. </char></note> hamu afolu anogo ine libo degesia, mole dafogoyone madenefia labeso.” Na auba selesi, ili bule wedinalehe, gine mana mololu amofea alefasia, aubasu moloyone libo degefia labeo.<verse eid="2CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Auluso, gine wi auba digiba kaiiba solu amo, ili Masedonia na balu soluba bolosi, nahe nelewo osoloamo aga gili labea hilibaisu. Ili gili labea goafia, gili mole ufiyone madenemesi sagoba ufiyobafe. Ausi, nahe noolofea gili saaba soluguba, gili seale mole dafogoyone madenefia miliyobafe. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Gili auba mole gagaiyofia madenelu labi, na dufia gili labea sobele saabi, Masedonia idele inolo noolo na galiba esenaga, amo ilihe gili mole aso madenebale labi bolosi. Ausenaga, nini amone yualo diyobafe. Ninisuale. Aubale. Gineda amone yualo diyobafe. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Aulune, ne nelewo osoloa ewe na saminiba, gili labea malaleyo hiliselu. Aufia, ilidale inigia, mole gili ulu meyobafeba saaba ufulu amo, molaba dibia gagaiyomalelu. Auba ausimo, hilia na-da gili labea saabimo, mole amo madenefia diba ufia miliyobafe. Auba molosenaga, gili hameselo mana amofea alefasia, habobale ligia, gine seba alebale ulu meluba sawaba waleyobafe.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godefea heafusia memale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 11:24-25">Snd 11.24-25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gili sulu ewe nafuluba asigima. Sebe fifisiamo, sesaiba ligia, wedino ule uleba fifisenaga, wedino ule uleba suiyobafe. Auluso, heafuba ligia, gene seba alebale wedinale fifisenaga, heneba wedinale suiyobafe. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Aulugulu, gili elebi elebiba, gine asigihe nafuluba osolafia, kegele gine meyo asigife amone memale. Ge asigi higinifia ligiamo, memabiyo. Aufia, inolo noolohe homaba egedidiba selaba labi, memabiyo. Enebamo, idele inolo heafuba ligia mefe ili amofea Godehe hameselo. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Aufia, Godehe gilifea wasiga sauufia, ediliba ufiyodolu koleba labe. Ehe gilifea auba ediliba ofelesimo, gili hilia sunia, kegele suniafealo ami, gine gili isoba dulu adesia, dabalu nafulu nokene nokeneba moloyone weaseba waalebasu miliyobafe. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 112:9">Sng 112.9</ref></char></note>Bama, Godene Bugohe idele inolo auba melo amone iminisia, eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CO 9:9" />
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">
    <char style="qt">“Inolo sebe geyone fifisia, sebe alegabale wedinale hele saabia fifiloguba,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">
    <char style="qt">ehe ene seba alebale ligia, weagulufea kegele wedinale sagaba melo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">
    <char style="qt">Idele inolo auba mololo amo, ine mana isolu alefalu alefaeyobafe.”</char><verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:10">Ais 55.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Godehe, sebeda fifilo inolofea geiya sebe fifimesi melo. Aufia, Ehe naiyo namenesi melo. Auba melogulu, Gode ule E-su, gilihe no anogofea sagamesine, Ehe kegele wedinale gilifea meyobafe. Aufia, Ehe gine mana isolu amone sebe amo, wedinale heleleba melesi, moloba ufiyobafe. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:11">2Kld 1.11</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 4:15">4.15</ref></char></note>Hilia sunia noolofea kegele heafusia memesine, Godehe kegele wedinale nokene nokenebamo, gilifea meyobafe. Aufia, gili heafuba ligia, ulu kegele mesi, nini dibia abia mefea amimo, idele inolo wedinale ili amohe, Godefea henelu buleba selaba miliyobafe.<verse eid="2CO 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Enebamo, gili Godene dabalu auba molofe amohe, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> abobolu alebaibu amofea sagoba ofelefe. Amosuale. Gili auba molofe amofea alefasia, idele inolo wedinalehe, Godefea henelu buleba saeyobafe koleba. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Maumo, gilihe ilifea heafuba sagoba ufiyoba ulufaba walesi, ilihe Godene wi digife. Enebamo, ili bisigia, gilihe <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> awalu sulu nafulu kuliba abia, gilihe ilifeada, idele inolo ili suniafeada, dafifia ligia, gine seba alebale meluba babiyobafe. Gili asigi ule ofelesia, fogaba soiya fogo amimo, Godene sulu dofasia kuliba maiyone eelu. Aulugulu, gili auba molobasu labe. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Aufia, ilihe Godene <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanululomo</char> gilifea wasigafia koleba labeba asigiyobafe. Ausiamo, ilihe gili bule koleba hamesia, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selesiamo</char>, Ehe gili nafuluba ediliba homesi saeyobafe. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Ulu kegele Godehe ninifea melu amomo, bule koleba, saeyoda babealu dobu. Ulu kegele ninifea melu amone Godefea wisoba saeyoba.<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Inolo noolohe Folone dabalu lasiaba selesi, e ene meleba subuyo sulu obegeba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 2:3">1Kld 2.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inolo noolohe, sulu nafealo amone dufa dafogoba selesia, eweguba solubiyo. “<char style="w">Folo</char> hago ligiamo, e ninifea sowi seleba mesiamo, ene sulu kolelu selesia, kiwidagulu besabe. Auluso, e ninidai nine si saabia ligia, amogulu bisigiale, ene meleba helea adesia, kiwidale labe.” Ili auba solubiyo. Auluso, asigima. <char style="w">Keliso</char> E onaba adesia, hamedofa ado. Aulugulu, nahe gilifea Ene mana amo hilisemalesia, sulu ewe saeyobasu. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:21">1Kld 4.21</ref></char></note>Seale, na gilifea eweguba susisu. Gili nafuluba koleba, na gilidai misiyo inigiamo, na sulu kolelu gilifea sodosi. Auluso, inolo noolohe, nini helefealune mana kuliba aafebuba hilisefe ili amofeamo, na sulu kolelu koleba saeyobasu. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Seale, ninimo, helefealu iwi solu. Auluso, helefealu inolohe belagulo amoguba, nini belagulale.<verse eid="2CO 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:13-17">Efe 6.13-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Belagulo kegele nini aga sebu ewemo, helefealune belagulo kegele amoguluale. Aubale. Belagulo kegele nini sebu amo, Godefea alefasia kiwigagalu dulu. Aulune, belagulo kegele amohe, gisane yala kolelu bidiba dafiyodolu koleba labe. <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />Gisa inolohe abanedai idai difasia, uleno anosi eno saugulaba kaaloguba, idele inolohe dawalolusia, ine mesegelu suludai, asigidai amo difasia, saugulafe amohe, Gode labea maiyone eno kaalo. Dawalolusia eno kaalo amo, nini belagusia bidiba dafolo. Kaamo inolohe ene gisadali dibolo dafogologuba, ninihe aubasu, nine asigi hilise Godedai gisa adefe amone, ili sunia dofafasia, dibolo dafogobasu ado. Ausi, nine asigi hilise sunia Keliso sisa diba ufia miliyobafe. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Gili Keliso sisa aleba samodofia labi, inolo sunia aso E sisa adale mana molofe amo isoyofia, nini ilifea mana saeyone madenefia lolu.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Gilihe kegele gili besabe amo, bado saabiasu bolo. Idele inolo abehe, e seale Kelisone koleba loluba asigisenaga, amo ehe eweda nafuluba asigiyo dobu. E-mo Kelisone koleba adefe amogubamo, ninida Kelisone koleba adesu. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 13:10">2Kld 13.10</ref></char></note>Seale, nini Kelisone koleba ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilofea</char> alefasia, wida solu lolu. Ehe nini gadefasia, gili woba dafiyone dabalu meluale. Aubale. Ninihe gili kiwigaaba homesine gadefalu. Amone saaba, nini nine wi digisia, sulu waseba kaiiba selesiabiaga, ulenoda nini yuaba ofaiyale. Mau amo seale. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Aulugulu, na sowi gili sagiliba ofelesia selelububa asigimabiyo. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Inolo noolohe na saaba selesiamo, eweguba solu. “Folohe sowi seleiya amimo, sulu higiniluda, sulu koleluda, selelu dobu. Auluso, ene e nini labea muluiya amimo, e kiwidale adesia, sulu e walelumo eleda male, fufulo hisu balugulu, dubulu.” <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Inolo abehe sulu auba selefe ili amofea sulu eweguba obegeba saamale. Na hele hago ligiamo, sowihe sulu kolelu gilifea seleba mebaiba ado. Aubasu, na inigia, gilidai adesiamo, auba waagi koleba saeyobasu. Inolo ili ogofea auba hilisemalema.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Inolo noolohe ine mana ulufaba baafia, ine meleba kaiisia, wi digiba ado. Auluso, nini nine meleba osolaba bisigia, ilidai iminisuale. Aubale. Nini iligulu loluba saeyo sagililo. Abe suniafelaba iminiba kelesia, ilihe ine meleba osolaba bolo. Ine meleba iminiyo kegele amomo, ine ili waaga koleba labe. Asigida male inolo amosu auba aulo.<verse eid="2CO 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:3">Lom 12.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, ninimo, aubasu nine meleba waseba bebeleba kaiiba saeyale. Aubale. Ninida dabalu moloba adefea amone elomo, Godehe ninifea ufulu dobu. Elo amo fila galisiale, ninihe nine elo ufuluiya amisu nine meleba kaiiba selesu. Kolidi gilida nine elo usu ami gegoaba labe. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Ninihe gili saaba nine meleba kaiiba selesenaga, nine ninida dabalu moloba labea amone elo fila galisuale. Aubale. Enebamo, Kelisone Awalu Sulu Nafuluda gilifea walelu inolomo, nini koleba olaibo lolu. Inolo no gili labea aso goabale labi, ninidale mulu. Aulune, ninihe gili saaba kaiimabiyoba saeyo elo ulenoda male.<verse eid="2CO 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Hogololu dabalu inolo noolo anogo mololu amone saaba, nini mololusia, nine meleba kaiiba saeyale. Dabalu ninifea melu amone elo ufulu amo, auba fila galiyale. Aubale. Auluso, nini eweguba <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasisu</char>. Gine <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> sobosi, dabalu nini moloba adefea amoda amogubasu buleyobafe. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Ausi, ninihe awalu sulu nafulu, mosomu gili faisalo kakainabufealo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Folohe iwi “mosomu gili faisalo kakainabuba” solu. Hele amomo, halo sugalofealo amone solu. Amomo, Kolidi sidida, Lome sidida, aufia Sefeini hele bule amoda, iminilu. (Hilibaisi Daalu 19.21, aufia, Lome 15.24-28 ami bamale.)</char></note>amoloda, saeyo maiyo. Inolo none elo ufuluiya usu ami, dabalu ama mololu amone saaba, nini mololusia, ninihe nine meleba kaiiba saeyale. Aubale. Inolo nohe dabalu aso mololuale labea fogo amisu, ninihe dabalu molofia kaiiba saeyobasu.<verse eid="2CO 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 9:24">Jer 9.24</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:31">1Kld 1.31</ref></char>
    </note>Godene Bugo usu eweguba selelu dobu. <char style="qt">“Idele inolo abehe kegele uleno saaba kaiiyo hamesenaga, kegele Saminilohe mololu amonesu kaiiba saeyo hamemale.”</char> <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:4">1Kld 4.4</ref></char></note>Enebamo, inolo ulenohe, ene e ulufaba baafia, ene wi ene meleba digife amo, Godene si saabia dedeba besabea amimo, hodobailu labe. Auluso, Saminilohe ulenone mana ulufaba baafia, ene wi digisenaga, amo e Godene si saabia, sunialu koleba labe.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Folohe saabia no ene meleba sububa solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Wae, na aga nene meleba kaiiba selesenaga, gili nafea habosiale, na auba wedino elawaneba melesi, fogo waagi memaleyobile?<verse eid="2CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:26-27">Efe 5.26-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Enaohe ene eleweli galagololusu melesi uluba adesia, yasiba adoguba, nada gili aubasu helegeba uluba adesia, yasiba lolu. Godefea alefasia, nahe gili inolo ulefea malesi saaba melu. Gili ido buda inoloda bolale amogulu galagololu labi, nahe gili <char style="w">Keliso</char> Ene olegia uluba sefia, Efea ifoyo hilisefe. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:4">Stt 3.4</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 3:13">13</ref></char></note>Auluso, na hilisesia, samini koleba soiyehe hahanoba selesia, Iba gegeluguba, gilifeada aubasu moloyobafeba sagiliba hilisesu. Auba molosimo, gine asigi Yesu Keliso Efeasu asigi gagaba adomo diba dafolosi, na sagilife. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:8-9">Gal 1.8-9</ref></char></note>Maumo, gili inolo noolofea asigi gagafebuba besabe. Enebamo, inolo abegulu gili labea goafe amo ehe, Yesu nini gilifea walelualegulu, Yesu no haiba gilifea walesenaga, gili inolo amo heneba uluba disia, ene sulu waagi sigiba dobelefe. Aufia, Asubane gili samini dulualegulu, asubane no haiba waagi dife. Aufia, awalu sulu nafulu gili samini sigiba dubulualegulu, haiba no walesi, gili waagi sigiba dobelefe. Gilihe inolo noolofea auba waagi walemesi fogo alebale mefe amone, na sagilife.<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 15:10">1Kld 15.10</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 12:11">2Kld 12.11</ref></char>
    </note>Wae, seale koleba. Inolo ili ogo <char style="w">hilibaisi daalu inolo</char> olaibo noekene ligia, ana koleba labebu. Auluso, na hilisesia, ilihe na sunialuale labebuba hilisesu. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:1">1Kld 2.1</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 2:13">13</ref></char></note>Nahe sulu mesegeba saeyofealo amone dawalolo dulualeba nafea selefeso, asigilofealo amonemo, na dawalolo dulu lolu. Dawalolo na dulu amo, nahe kegele suniafealomo gilifea fadaba ulufaba walelu. <verse eid="2CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:18">1Kld 9.18</ref></char></note> Godene awalu sulu nafulu gilifea walesiamo, nahe mole gilifea haalisia waleluale. Aubale. Na mole dibale waleba alolu amomo, gili sisa adesia, gili ana digiba ufiyofia aulu. Na mana mololu amohe, gilihe na mana <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> mololuba asigifela? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:15-16">Fil 4.15-16</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 12:13">2Kld 12.13</ref></char></note><char style="w">Sese</char> noolohe nafea sagoba ofolo mole mesi, na gili aleba ugi dabalu moloyone, mole amo dulu. Na ine mole difasia labi, aga sese ili ogo bisigia, mole fa molaba samodolububa besabe.<verse eid="2CO 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Hilia na gilidai alolu fogomo, na kegele kelesimo, higinilu gilifea melale. Aubale. Keliso damenedali <char style="w" lemma="Masedonia">Masedoniafia</char> Kolidi mulu ili amohe, kegele na male alolumo, ili amo melo. Auba molosimo, nahe higinilu gilifea mebale alolu. Aufia, dufiada, higinilu auba gilifea meyalene, na nene meleba enogele miliyo. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Keliso Ene seale sulu sodomo nadai labegulu, na sulu seale koleba saaba ofelesu. Gilifea waleba ligiamo, na gilifea mole duluale amone kaiiba selaba miliyo. Aufia, <char style="w">Akaea</char> hele fogoba asulu amo sunia, kaiiba solu sulu amo saeyone, inolo ulenohe na kaeyobafale. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Na auba mololumo, mau ene? Maumo, na gili hameselualene aufebile? Aubale koleba! Nahe gili bule hamesebubamo, Gode Eda asigifia labe.<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Inolo ili ogohe, idele inolone si saabiamo, nini hamagulu alebaiyesia, ninidai iminiyone eno kelefe. Ausi, ili auba Fologulu lolusia ine wi kaiiba adosi, na eno kaeyo hamefe. Aulugulu, na gili aleba ami mole haalibale dabalu mololuguba, na aso auba waagi mololabia daaba miliyobasu. Enebamo, ili ogo mole haalilale miliyo hamefalene, ili amone kaiiba saeyodoluale miliyobafe. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Maumo, ili ogo seale hilibaisi daalu inoloale. Aubale. Ili masega gegeba ligia, dabalu moloba ado. Auba gegeba ligia, ilihe Kelisone hilibaisi daalu inolo amogulu mesenefia, muguba ofelesia, masega molosia waalefe. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Auluso, ninihe mana ili molofe amone baafia hidigimabiyo. Enebamo, <char style="w">Sedene</char> ene eda, <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">Godene sulu dia ano</char> yaneda yasilo amogulu mesenefia, aubasu muguba ofelesia, masega moloba labe. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Ausi, Sedene ene dabalu mololo ilimo, isolu dabalu mololo amogulu mesenefia, auba muguba masega molofe amo baaba, gili hidigimabiyo. Eweguba hilisema. Dufiamo, ili ine dabalu molofe amone elebe diyobafe.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folo e hilibaisi daalu dabalu molosimo, higinilu wedinale diabia daalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Na sulu ewe saabia selesu. Gilihe hilisesia, na elawanesia, babeaba selefebuba hilisemabiyo. Auluso, gilihe, na elawanesia babeaba selefebuba hilisesenaga, hama, amoda isobu. Auluso, gili auba hilisesenaga, amo gili elawanelu inolo waagi melesi gadefaloguba, nene nada melesi gadefasia, na wedino kaiiba samesi waagi fogo memaleyobile. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Sulu ewe <char style="w">Saminilo</char> asigifeguba selesuale. Aubale. Enebamo, na nene meleba kaiiba selesiamo, elawanelu inolo sodoguba selesu. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Inolo wedinale noolo ili ogohe, helefealune mana amone kuliba abiamo, ine meleba kaiiba selaba alolu. Auba aulugulu, nada ne wimo waagi kaiiba saeyoba.<verse eid="2CO 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Gilihe na auba elawaneba melesi habosiale gadefaeyobafeba asigisu. Enebamo, asigida labe inolo gili kolebamo, asigidale inolo ili waagi gilidai ligia, elawaneba melesi habosiale gadefalo. <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Seale, inolo noolohe gili ine balu dabalu molomesi iluwasenaga, gilihe ili auba aumesi habosiale gadefalo. Aufia, gilihe ilifea gine kegele waagi molaba samodomesi gadefalo. Gilihe ilifea waagi gili masega gegesia, gine kegele fa dimalelo. Aufia, gilihe ilifea waagi ine meleba ana homalelo. Aufia, gilihe ilifea waagi gine olegi dowemalelo. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:5">Fil 3.5</ref></char></note>Yeele, na kiwi sanelu inolo ligia, ili ogo molologuba na moloyodoluale adefe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Auba saeyone na yuafe. Auluso, inolo noolo ili ine wi kaiiba saeyone yuasalenaga, amo nada auba saeyone yuafale. Asigima. Na auba selesumo, na elawaneba selesu.<verse eid="2CO 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Inolo ogo ilihe, nini <char style="w">Hibulu</char> mosomu inolo lolusia, ine meleba kaiiba selefela?</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CO 11:22">Amo, nada Hibulu mosomu inolo lolu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:22">Ilihe, <char style="w" lemma="Isolaele">Isolaele inolo</char> labeba selefela?</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CO 11:22">Amo, nada Isolaele inolo lolu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:22">Ilimo, <char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamane</char> saladegelu amofeafia hugafia labela?</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CO 11:22">Amo, nada Abalahamane saladegelu amofeafia hugafia lolu.<verse eid="2CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:23">HD 16.23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ilimo, ine meleba saaba selesia, “Nini Kelisone dabalu mololo loluba” selefela?</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CO 11:23">Amo, na aso elawaneba ligia, nene meleba kaiisia, eweguba selesu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CO 11:23" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:23">Na ili suniafia, Kelisone dabalu waseba moloba lolu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:23">Seale, hogoloba molosia, na ili sunialu dobu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:23">Aufia, Kelisone dabalu mololu amo alefasia, na dibolo dafogolu fogo amone alegalumo, ine alegalu wasolu koleba.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:23">Noolohe na wedinale dufulabasu adeso.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:23">Aufia, fogo wedinale amimo na olaeyomo hagoale adabasu adeso.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:23">Amoneda na ili amo suniafia lolu.<verse eid="2CO 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 25:3">Lo 25.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fogo biaba ami, <char style="w">Yuda</char> ilihe nafea mana saeyone fegoba doweso.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:24">Auba ausiamo, ilihe ine mana kuliba abia, namo daabuluba osoloafia agofoloba doweso.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 25.1-3 amo eweguba selefe. Isolaele inolo ilihe, inolo ulenofea mana saeyone fegoba dowesenaga, daabuluba biniba suniamabiyoba elo ufulu dobu. Auluso, Yuda ili hilisesia, ili heleba alegasia, iminilu sunialosiba hiliselo. Ausiane, ilihe inolo uleno mana selesia, e fegoba dowesiamo, daabuluba osoloafia agofoloba (39) fegoba dowelo. </char></note><verse eid="2CO 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 14:19">HD 14.19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 16:22">16.22</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:27-44">27.27-44</ref></char>
    </note>Fogo osoloaba noolohe na i solobo dufeleso.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:25">Aufia, hilia ulenomo, ilihe na abane odeso.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:25">Fogo osoloaba hano sibi nada asulumo woso.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:25">Aufia nigili ule, hilia ule, na salu hano galulu saabia haubagafia siba alolu.<verse eid="2CO 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 9:23">HD 9.23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:50">13.50</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:15">14.15</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:3">20.3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 23:10-11">23.10-11</ref></char>
    </note>Hilia sunia na siba aloiya amimo, na haloaeyo nokene nokeneba bolo.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:26">Hano segelabia daaba labida, na haloaeyo bolo.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:26">Fadilo inolo ilifea alefasiada, na haloaeyo bolo.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:26">Ne damenedali, Yuda mosomu ilifea alefasiada, na haloaeyo bolo.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:26">
    <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">Yau mosomu</char> inolo ilifea alefasiada, na haloaeyo bolo.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:26">Na sidi bule amo siba labida, na haloaeyo bolo.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:26">Na inoloda maleiya helea siba labida, na haloaeyo bolo.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:26">Salu hano galulu saabia siba labida, na haloaeyo bolo.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:26">Aufia, masega sigidubulu idele inolo ilifea alefasiada, na haloaeyo bolo.<verse eid="2CO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Na hilia wedinale naiyo nabale ligia,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:27">Nigili wedinale hanebale ligia,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:27">Dabalu hogololu nokene nokeneba mololo.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:27">Na mamiaba ligia,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:27">Hano nabaiyeba ado.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CO 11:27">Aufia, na fagulo malene, domala badiba ado.<verse eid="2CO 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Higinilu amone saabiamo, na <char style="w">sese</char> sunia nafuluba uluba miliyo amone, nahe hilia sunia keleba hilisebasu ado. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Sigidubulu idele inolo aleba uleno abehe kiwi sanelu adesenaga, gili eweguba hilisema. Nada kiwi saneba lolu. Aufia, uleno wolu moloyone kani usu sugasenaga, amohe de-gulu ne libo usu adesia, nada naba samodofe. <figure style="fig" alt="Shipwrecked" file="44_Ac_27_22_RG_gr.tif" size="col" copy="© Sweet Publishing http://sweetpublishing.com, licensed under a CC: BY-SA 3.0 Unported licence." ref="11.25">Fogo osoloaba hano sibi Foloda asulumo wolu.</figure><verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Isobu. Ulenohe na iluwasia, nene meleba kaiiba saamasenaga, amo na kiwi sanelu lolu ewene kaiiba saeyoba. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Na sulu selesiamo, na masega sulu sodale. Gode, nine Saminilo Yesune Enao, ehe amo asigibu. Hilia sunia, ninihe Ene wi digibasu ligia, alefalu miliyoba.<verse eid="2CO 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 9:23-25">HD 9.23-25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Saminimo, hilia uleno, na Damasegese sidi ami alolu fogo ami, kini Aledasene gamane yasilo ulenohe na seyofia, yobolo inolo noolohe sidi amone yalalu eno kia gele ufia yasiba yaamesi gadefaso. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:25">HD 9.25</ref></char></note> Ausi, nelewodali noolohe na selege alu bule usu ami mesafia, sidi bule amone yala usu ami, wido eno olaboba ufulu amohe, efolo godaifia, helea iligi esebalo esebaloba dafogoso. Na auba fisaba aasi, gamanene yasilo inolohe na sesale.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Folo ehe halaga abulu amodai, e kiwidale alolu amodai, solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Eno no male dobu. Na nene meleba kaiiba saeyobasu. Seale, mana amohe nini sagoba ufiyobafale. Auluso, hama. Halaga abulu amoneda, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> sulu muguba ufulu ulufaba walelu amoneda, na aga gilifea saeyobasu.<verse eid="2CO 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Doma. Hamu dabaluba ulene biniba afolufealo faisa ami, Kelisodai kulifia alolu inolo uleno<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Folo ehe ene wi kaiiba saeyo hamesialemo, kegele efea holobagalu amomo, inolo nofea mololune sodoguba besi solu. </char></note>, Godehe e-mo <char style="w">hebene</char> osolo lagi<note caller="†" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hebene osolo</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba solu ewe, eneba iminiba selesia aulubi, nini babeafe. </char></note> dibia aaso. E domalada labibile? Na babeafe. Me domaladale labibile? Na babeafe. Gode E-su asigibu. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3-4" />Auluso, na asigife ewe, Godehe inolo amo dibia, Faladaisi aaso. E domalada labibile? Me domaladale labibile? Na babeafe. Gode E-su asigibu. Aufia, Faladaisi lagi dobelesufalumo, ehe kegele inolo uleno ulufaba saaba dafelagoyodoluale amone dobeleso. Kegele e dubulu amomo, sodale kegelebiyo. Amomo, ulenoda waagi samesi fogo melale labe. <verse eid="2CO 12:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Na inolo amone kaiiba selesu. Auluso, na nene meleba kaiiba saeyale. Kaiiba saeyo sunia auba afelesiaso, ule ewesu na kaiiba saeyo. Na kiwi saneba ado amone, kaiiba selesu.<verse eid="2CO 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Seale, na halaga auba abulumone kaiiba selesiabiaga, amo na asigidale elawaneba sabaiyale. Enebamo, na seale sulusu sabaiye. Auluso, na halaga auba abuluda, sodale kegele dubuluda, auba awaba selesi dofasia, idele inolo ilihe amofea alefasia, na osolasia, inolo wida bulebuba hiliselosi, na nene meleba kaiiba saeyale. Aubale. Ilihe mana na molosi bisigiada, sulu na selesi dobelesiada, na osolaba besenaga, amo nafulu.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 2:6">Jop 2.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Godehe nafea ulufaba walelu amo, inolo nofea walelualegulu, wasolu dobiyo. Auluso, nene na-mo amone nene meleba bamabamasia ana digilosi, nafea kegele uleno nabaiiye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nabaiiye </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Foloda bubagalu amo besiba selesia, amene iminiba solubi, nini babeafe. Kegele amohe, efea woba ufuluba, nini auba asigifia lolu.</char></note> bubagaloguba, ne domalafea bubagamesi moloso. Kegele amo, <char style="w" lemma="Sedene">Sedenene</char> sulu dia ano amogulu adesia, na woba ufiyone saabeo. Na nene meleba ne wi digilosine, naga amo na dufa dafogoyone mulu labe. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Fogo osoloaba, nahe Saminilofea sulu selesiamo, kegele nafea bubagabu amo, duguba damaba susiba solu. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:11-13">Fil 4.11-13</ref></char></note>Ausi, Ehe nafea eweguba obegeba seleso. “Ne <char style="w">kanululo</char> ewesu gafea ililiba dobu. Mau enebamo, kiwigagaluhe, kiwisanefea amisu moloba samodolo.” Saminilohe auba solugulu, agamo, na kaiiba selesiamo, na kiwi sanelu adefe amone henesia, kaiiba selesu. <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> kiwigagalu nafea melesine, na auba ausu. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Aulugulu, Keliso Ene wi digiyonemo, na kiwi saneba adefeada, inolo nohe na elasabiafea amida, higinilu nokene nokeneba difea amida, inolo noolohe na woba ofelefea amida, na henelo. Maumo, nene na kiwi saneba adefea amimo, na kiwigagalu ami ado.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Kolidi sese nafulu mesesi, asigi gagaba alolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 11:5">2Kld 11.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Wae! Sulu na lagi kaiiba solu amo, asigidale inolo sodoguba, elawaneba solu. Auluso, gilihe nafea auba elawaneba samesi egedidiso. Enebamo, gilihe mana nafulu na mololomo, ulufaba baafia, ne wi digiba dafelagoyodoluso, gili auba ausale. Amone baafia, sulu amo nene meleba saaba dafelagosia, ne wimo, nene na digilu. Maumo, na widale koleba labinagada, ili <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibaisi daalu</char> noekene lolusia alebaibu ogohe, kegele ulenofealo amoda, na suniabuale koleba.<verse eid="2CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:19">Lom 15.19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Na gilidai aloiya fogo ami, nahe, kiwi sanefia afelesiale, eloba bamesine kegele nooloda, dabalu kolelu nonobada molosia, <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> nonobada, gilifea waleba alolu. Gilihe na hilibaisi daalu dabalu seale molofebuba eloba bamesimo, gilifea auba walelabia daabasu alolu. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:9">2Kld 11.9</ref></char></note>Auluso, gili hilisesia, “Folohe <char style="w">sese</char> noolo bule sagoba ofelesia, ninifea aboboba molofeba” hiliseba labe. Auba hilisemabiyo. Amo sealeale. Aa, kegele ulenosu na gilifea aboboba mololu. Amo ewe, nene meleba uluba miliyone, na sese noolofea mole haaliluso, gilifea auba memalesia haaliluale. Yeele! Na gilifea auba heleba mololumo, gili na waagi hamasia heesia galimaleyobile?<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Aga na fogo osolo gili labea miyone, madenefia lolu. Fogo eweda na gilifea mole haaliyale. Aubale. Maumo, na gili labea inigia isasumo, gine kegeleale. Aubale. Na gine gili koleba isasu. Enebamo, gili hilisebu, enaedai enaodai sagoba ufiyone, naiyoda, mole kegeleda, molaeyone dabalumo, faibe deseine ineale. Aubale. Enaedai enaodai aaluhe aine faibe sagoba ufiyone, naiyoda, mole kegeleda molaeyomo, aine dabalu dobu. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Aulugulu, nahe gili sagoba ofelesiamo, ne kegele dobu amo suniada, ne miliyoluda, na heafuba weaseba meyoba. Na gili auba bule hamesesimo, gili nafea sabe hamesesiamo, wedino hamesesela?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Nene na uluba miliyomo, gine kegele dilale. Aubamo, gili asigibu. Auluso, gili aleba ugi, inolo noolohe ne mana amone hilisesiamo, eweguba selefe. “E aliliba sodo inolo ligia, ene meleba sagoba ufiyosia, ninifeamo muguba ofelesia, gegeba ado.” <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Ili auba selesi, na eweguba selesu. Eneba labe? Inolo noolo nahe gili labea hilibailu ili amofea alefasia, gili gegefasia, gine kegele molaba dulubiyola? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:6">2Kld 8.6</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 8:16-18">16-18</ref></char></note>Nahe <char style="w" lemma="Daidasa">Daidasamo</char> gili labea malalesia, nelewo no e galiba malesi hilibailu. Auluso, Daidasa e gili labea milifasia, gilimo gegefasia, kegele molaba dulubiyola? Aubale, Daidasa ani, asubane uluse ado. Aufia, ani mana uluse hamagulu ligia, kuliba daaba ado.<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Sowi ewe alegafea fogo ami, gili eweguba asigiba adefebu. “Folo ehe nine si saabiamo isolu miliyosia, efea lasiaba sulu selefe amone obegesia, ene meleba sububa selabasu labe.” Gili auba asigimabiyo. Nini Kelisofea kulifia ligia, Godene si saabia ligia, selaba lolu. Ne yagusodali, nini mololo amo sunia, gili kiwigaaba ufiyone mololo.<verse eid="2CO 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Na sagilifemo ewe. Na gili labea ugi inigiamo, gilimo inolo na babiyo hamelu amogulu labi bolosiale. Aufia, gili na bisigiamo, na-mo, inolo gilihe babiyo hamelu amogulu labi bolosiale. Na sagilife. Na milifasiamo, mana ewegulumo gili olea ugi labi, babiyobafebile? Sulu kowelo mana amoda, gadilo mana amoda, inolo nofea babiyo habolo mana amoda, elelifia gaidaboba sodo mana amoda, bado gelelo mana amoda, kaiilo mana amoda, aufia elelilo mana amoda, dabalu dabagalaba moloba ofolo mana amoda, mana amogulu sunia dobi babiyobafebilesia, na sagilife. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 13:2">2Kld 13.2</ref></char></note>Na gili labea inigiamo, na hilisesia, ne Godehe na-mo saabia waagi helea melesi moloba ufiyobafeba hilisebu. Aulune, na sagilife. Enebamo, gili labea ami, noolo auba wolu molobasu labi bisigia, na yuasia, libo higiniyobafe. Samini, nugumalu manada, susugu mana amoda, wolu moloyone libo degelo mana amoda, ilihe mololuso, ili aga aso nolofia <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besisiale</char>, aso moloba labi bisigia, na auba yuasia, libo higiniyobafe.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Mana wolumo molomesiale hagugulu sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 19:15">Lo 19.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:16">Mad 18.16</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:19">1Dim 5.19</ref></char>
    </note>Aga na gili labea sobele miyobasu ewemo, fogo osolo. Bama. Godene Bugo eweguba selelu dobu. <char style="qt">“Sulu fadaafea ami, inolo aidahe, me osoloahe, molosi si abuluba selesenaga, amo sealesia fadaayobafe.”</char> <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Na gili labea aganebo mulumo, na gilidai ligiamo, inolo samini woba moloba alolu ilifeada, aufia idele inolo suniafeada, hagugulu sulu ama solu. Aufia, aga na aso gilidai alebale hago ligiamo, nahe ilifea saabia auba haguguba seleba mebaisu ewe. Na haiba gili labea obegeba milifasiamo, nahe inolo ili amo waagi wolu moloba melesi gadefaeyale. Aubale. Nahe ili isoyo.<verse eid="2CO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Auba moloyobasumo mau ewe. “Folohe <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> sulu seale walefebilesia,” gili keleba ligia, na dedeba babiyo weiyaafe. Aulune, gilihe na dedeba besabea ami, na suniafia loluba bamesine, na auba moloyobasu. Doma. Yesu Keliso Ehe gine mana amone isosiamo, E kiwi sanesiale, Ene kiwimo seale koleba gilifea waleyobafe. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:7-8">Fil 2.7-8</ref></char></note>Seale, Yesu kiwida saneba ada ami alolu amo alefasia, E <char style="w">imolane</char> uluba ofelesi, olalu. Auluso, Godene kiwigagaluda ada ami labe amo alefasia, E miliyolu difasia, bebea saabe. Aulugulu, nini Efea kulifia adesimo, E kiwi sanelu alolugubamo, ninida aubasu kiwi sanelu adefe. Auluso, Godene kiwigagaluda ada ami nini lolu amo alefasia, nini Kelisodai ligia, gili aleba aubasu miliyobasu.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 11:28">1Kld 11.28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, gili koleba, gine <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulumo</char> gili seale ufululaba, me ufulualelaba osolaba bama. Seale, amofealomo, gine meleba dedeba bama. Auba gine meleba isaba bisigia, Yesu Keliso gilifea labela, dedeba bama. E gine miliyolu usu ami malenaga, ga seale dedeba besabea ami hodobaife. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Auluso, na eweguba hamefe. Nini auba dedeba besabea ami hodobailuale loluba, gili auba eloba bamesi hamefe. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Aga ninihe gili hilisesia, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu saaba</char> ofelesumo, gilimo wolu kegele uleno molomesiale selesu. Idele inolohe na bisigia, dedeba abuluiya ami, nini sunialu labeba bamesisia, nini Godedai sulu selesuale. Aubale, Nini Edai sulu selesumo mau ewe. Gilihe nini hodobailuba hilisesenagada, hama. Nini gili koleba mana nafulu molomesi hamefe. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Gili asigife. Ninihe seale sulu sodo dufa dafogoyone, moloyo kegele uleno male koleba. Aubale. Ninihe seale sulu sodo amone sagoba ufiyo amonesu, dabalu moloyo dobu. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Aulugulu, gilimo kiwida adesi, ninimo kiwidale adesenagada, amo nini henelo. Aufia, hilia sunia ninihe Godedai sulu selesiamo, gili dedeba besabi, gili suniaeyomone nafuluba madenefia melesi sodo.<verse eid="2CO 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 10:8">2Kld 10.8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> na Ene dabalu amone uluba melesi iminisia, wida solu kiwigagalu melesi gadefalu. Aufia, aga na aso hago ligia, sowi ewe gilifea seleba mesu. Mau ene, na gili labea inigiamo, gine mana mololu amomo, aso isoyone dabalu haiba uleno male miliyobasu. Saminilohe dabalu ewe nafea melu amomo, gine asigi ule ufulu woba homesine meluale. Aubale. Gilimo kiwigaaba homesine, Ehe dabalu amo nafea melu.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elosia, Folohe hawiyoba selefe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Ne nelewodali, nanodali, na sulu samodosia, sulu ewe aso saeyo hamefe. Gili henemale. Gili suniaeyone madeneba melale. Aufia, gili gine geleba, no nofea kiwigaaba homale. Aufia, gili gine geleba hilise ule adesia, gilihe noolo anogodai seloaba ufia mesale. Gode E-mo, hameselo manadai, <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealo manadai</char>, amone mau labe. E gili galiba miliyobafe.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Gilimo, gine geleba heneba wakalisiamo, <char style="w" lemma="Muuba kalilu">muuba kalifia</char> mimiba wakalimale. <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> iwi kakainabu, ili suniahe gilifea hawiyoba selefe.<verse eid="2CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Saminilo Yesu Kelisone kanululoda,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 13:13">Godene hameseloda,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 13:13">Asubane Noekene gilidai dafifia ado manada,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 13:13">amo gili suniadai miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 13:13">
    <figure style="fig" alt="End of book bilas" file="EndOfBookOnobasulu_Epistles.tiff" size="span" loc="End of Book" ref="13.13" /><verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>